Browser STT adaptation (2026): optional WebGPU encoder graph. The packed
upstream external weights, tokenizer, frontend, decoder and joint models are
unchanged. Floating zero-point MatMulNBits operations are expressed using an
integer midpoint plus an explicit linear correction for WebGPU compatibility.
This changes floating-point evaluation order; it is not training or
requantization. Reproduction: scripts/prepare-fluid-webgpu.py in Browser STT.
Source: https://github.com/mjtomei/browser-stt
